## 2. ⏰ Reminder Polling & Execution Workflow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start(["Start 1-Minute Polling Loop"]) --> QueryDB["Query sunfra_unified_reminders WHERE trigger_time <= NOW"]
    QueryDB --> CheckDue{"Any Due Reminders?"}
    
    CheckDue -- "No" --> Sleep["Wait 1 Minute"] --> Start
    CheckDue -- "Yes" --> LoopReminders["For Each Due Reminder"]
    
    LoopReminders --> FetchSubmissions["Fetch Today's Submissions (sunfra_processed_data) & Raw Messages (sunfra_raw_messages)"]
    FetchSubmissions --> VerifyReports["Run Dynamic Verification Engine"]
    
    VerifyReports --> AllSubmitted{"Are ALL Assigned Reports Submitted?"}
    
    AllSubmitted -- "Yes" --> MarkSkipped["Mark Reminder Status = 'skipped'"]
    MarkSkipped --> LogSkipped["Log Execution: 'All assigned reports submitted on time'"]
    LogSkipped --> AdvanceTime["Advance trigger_time to next schedule (Daily / Weekly / Monthly)"]
    AdvanceTime --> NextReminder
    
    AllSubmitted -- "No" --> CheckCount{"How Many Reports Missing?"}
    
    CheckCount -- "1 Report" --> FormatSingle["Build Single Report Message:\n'Please submit today's *Report Name* Report...'"]
    CheckCount -- "2+ Reports" --> FormatMulti["Build Multi-Report Bold Bullet Message:\n'Please submit the following pending reports:\n  • *Report 1*\n  • *Report 2*'"]
    
    FormatSingle --> SendWAHA["Send Message via WAHA API (POST /api/sendText)"]
    FormatMulti --> SendWAHA
    
    SendWAHA --> MarkSent["Mark Reminder Status = 'sent'"]
    MarkSent --> LogSent["Log Execution in sunfra_reminder_logs"]
    LogSent --> CheckRepeat{"Is Repeat (Nagging) Interval Enabled?"}
    
    CheckRepeat -- "Yes (5m/10m/15m)" --> ScheduleNag["Set Next trigger_time = NOW + Interval"]
    CheckRepeat -- "No / Done" --> NextReminder["Next Reminder in Queue"]
    
    ScheduleNag --> NextReminder
    NextReminder --> Sleep
```

