## 3. 🔍 Submission Verification Decision Tree

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Input["Incoming Report / Message"] --> CheckSender{"Does Sender Phone / Name Match Reminder Assignee?"}
    
    CheckSender -- "No" --> CheckGroup{"Does Message Group JID Match Reminder Group JID?"}
    CheckSender -- "Yes" --> CheckCategory
    
    CheckGroup -- "No" --> NotMatched["Not Matched -> Marked Missing (❌)"]
    CheckGroup -- "Yes" --> CheckCategory{"Does Message Category / Keywords Match Assigned Report?"}
    
    CheckCategory -- "Keywords Match" --> CheckTime{"Is Report Specific Time Window Matched? (e.g. Morning / Evening)"}
    CheckCategory -- "No Keyword Match" --> NotMatched
    
    CheckTime -- "Yes" --> Matched["Report Identified as Submitted (🟢)"]
    CheckTime -- "No" --> NotMatched
```

