## 4. 🚨 9:30 PM Company-Wise Escalation Report Workflow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    CronStart(["9:30 PM IST Cron Trigger"]) --> ExecEscalation["Run manager_escalation_job()"]
    
    ExecEscalation --> FetchTasks["Fetch Today's Tasks & Overdue Tasks"]
    ExecEscalation --> FetchReminders["Fetch Today's Scheduled Reminders"]
    ExecEscalation --> FetchMessages["Fetch Today's Raw WhatsApp Messages & Processed Data"]
    
    FetchReminders --> GroupByCompany["Group Reports by Company / Department\n(Accounts Poultry, Sunfra Corporate P&L, Jataayu Updates, etc.)"]
    
    GroupByCompany --> SortCompanyItems["Sort Items Within Each Company:\n1. Missing Items (❌) at TOP\n2. Submitted Items (🟢) at BOTTOM"]
    
    SortCompanyItems --> SortCompanies["Sort Company Sections:\nCompanies with Missing Items at TOP"]
    
    SortCompanies --> AssembleText["Assemble Final WhatsApp Message Text"]
    
    AssembleText --> SendTarget["Send WhatsApp Message ONLY to 7259510983 (Kusum)"]
    
    SendTarget --> Complete(["Escalation Report Delivered! 🚀"])
```
